Package: TaxisPhenotypeEvaluation
Title: TAXIS Network Phenotype Evaluation and Benchmark Package
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gowtham", "Rao", email = "gowtham.rao@coreason.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stephen", "Bandeian", email = "sbandeian@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Shaun", "Grannis", email = "sgrannis@regenstrief.org", role = "aut"),
    person("J. Marc", "Overhage", email = "overhage@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Evaluates 5 clinical phenotypes generated automatically from the TAXIS Knowledge Graph
  (COPD, Obesity, CKD, Hyperkalemia, Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus) against comparator cohorts from the
  OHDSI Phenotype Library on OMOP CDM databases. Generates cohort counts, patient-level overlap
  (Jaccard similarity), CohortDiagnostics characterization, and PheValuator diagnostic performance
  characteristics (Sensitivity, Specificity, PPV) with complete privacy preservation and zero patient-level data export.
